      "message": "Question but probably the answer is in other place: who will set this flag in where?\n\nIs this need to be specified by caller along with NET_CAPABILITY_LOCAL_NETWORK in NetworkRequest? If so, what is the semantic when a caller make NetworkCallback(FLAG_INCLUDE_LOCAL_NETWORKS) but no NET_CAPABILITY_LOCAL_NETWORK in NetworkRequest,  or vice versa?",
