      "writtenOn": "2023-08-15T08:33:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ok but with this semantics we\u0027ll create a use case, where the caller is not familiar with what he is doing, and\ncreate a NetworkCallback(without a flag) but with NET_CAPABILITY_LOCAL_NETWORK in the NetworkRequest.\nNot for this CL, IIUC This is a invalid use case and is very errorprone. We might want to have a clear exception for them to prevent the developer from debug to death.",
